{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EqqEpbi5SNQdhT9bLPh47u","type":"tool_result","content":"### type Key\n\n```ts\ntype Key = readonly [number, Pose, Ease?]\n```\n\n`[frame, pose, easeToNextKey?]`\n\n### interface LegDef\n\n- `rest: readonly [number, number]`: Where the foot rests, in the body's space (x right, z forward; y ignored).\n- `partners?: readonly number[]`: Legs that must not be lifting when this one starts a step (its neighbours; mutual, so listing a pair once is enough).\n\n### class LegStepper\n\n135:    // The hero: the bundled model and clips on a Mario-64-style controller.\n260:`HERO_MODEL`, `HERO_RIG` and `HERO_CLIPS` are its model and clips:\n1473:type CharacterAnim = 'Idle' | 'Walk' | 'Jump'\n1496:- `attachAnimations(model: Object3D, clips: readonly AnimationClip[]): void`: Attach a model's animation clips (expects Idle / Walk / Jump).\n2159:- `walk?: boolean`: Walk / tiptoe modifier.\nIdle IdleLook Teeter Tiptoe Walk Run Skid SkidTurn StepUp StepDown Crouch CrouchWalk CrouchSlide ProneDown Prone Crawl GetUpFront Sit SitDown StandUp LieDown LieIdle Sleep GetUp Jump JumpUp DoubleJump TripleJump Backflip SideFlip LongJump WallKick WallSlide Fall Dive BellySlide GroundPoundSpin GroundPound GroundPoundLand Land HardLand Slide Hang ShimmyRight ShimmyLeft PullUp ClimbIdle Climb Push PushIdle Grab Pull Punch Punch2 Kick SweepKick JumpKick Wave Victory Hurt Slash1 Slash2 Slash3 Slam LeapSlam Spin Cast CastBig CastWeapon CastBigWeapon BowDraw BowRelease Roll Charge Shout HitReact Death Triumph\n{\"name\":\"Slash1\",\"fast\":true,\"frames\":12,\"grounded\":true,\"keys\":[[0,{\"Pelvis\":{\"r\":[0,-8,0],\"p\":[0,-0.07,0],\"s\":1},\"Torso\":[8,6,0],\"Head\":[-6,2,0],\"ArmR\":[-38,0,-22],\"ForearmR\":[-70,0,0],\"HandR\":[10,0,0],\"ArmL\":[-30,0,18],\"ForearmL\":[-80,0,0],\"HandL\":[-10,0,0],\"FootR\":{\"r\":[-36.917,8,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"FootL\":{\"r\":[-30.097,8,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"LegR\":{\"r\":[-23.979,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"ShinR\":{\"r\":[60.896,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"LegL\":{\"r\":[-30.056,0,0],\"p\":[0,\n{\"name\":\"Walk\",\"frames\":12,\"loop\":true,\"keys\":[[0,{\"HandR\":[-15,0,0],\"HandL\":[-15,0,0],\"Pelvis\":{\"r\":[0,0,0],\"p\":[0,-0.08339566987447491,0],\"s\":[1.008037401924685,0.9839251961506301,1.008037401924685]},\"Torso\":{\"r\":[7,-12,-0.28232493995554314],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"Head\":{\"r\":[-7.5,9.60000000000","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7f78278-523d-4db5-bad6-0b641e53d240","uuid":"66b821e3-70a3-44fb-8782-ac7857edae63","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:37:06.063Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### type Key\n\n```ts\ntype Key = readonly [number, Pose, Ease?]\n```\n\n`[frame, pose, easeToNextKey?]`\n\n### interface LegDef\n\n- `rest: readonly [number, number]`: Where the foot rests, in the body's space (x right, z forward; y ignored).\n- `partners?: readonly number[]`: Legs that must not be lifting when this one starts a step (its neighbours; mutual, so listing a pair once is enough).\n\n### class LegStepper\n\n135:    // The hero: the bundled model and clips on a Mario-64-style controller.\n260:`HERO_MODEL`, `HERO_RIG` and `HERO_CLIPS` are its model and clips:\n1473:type CharacterAnim = 'Idle' | 'Walk' | 'Jump'\n1496:- `attachAnimations(model: Object3D, clips: readonly AnimationClip[]): void`: Attach a model's animation clips (expects Idle / Walk / Jump).\n2159:- `walk?: boolean`: Walk / tiptoe modifier.\nIdle IdleLook Teeter Tiptoe Walk Run Skid SkidTurn StepUp StepDown Crouch CrouchWalk CrouchSlide ProneDown Prone Crawl GetUpFront Sit SitDown StandUp LieDown LieIdle Sleep GetUp Jump JumpUp DoubleJump TripleJump Backflip SideFlip LongJump WallKick WallSlide Fall Dive BellySlide GroundPoundSpin GroundPound GroundPoundLand Land HardLand Slide Hang ShimmyRight ShimmyLeft PullUp ClimbIdle Climb Push PushIdle Grab Pull Punch Punch2 Kick SweepKick JumpKick Wave Victory Hurt Slash1 Slash2 Slash3 Slam LeapSlam Spin Cast CastBig CastWeapon CastBigWeapon BowDraw BowRelease Roll Charge Shout HitReact Death Triumph\n{\"name\":\"Slash1\",\"fast\":true,\"frames\":12,\"grounded\":true,\"keys\":[[0,{\"Pelvis\":{\"r\":[0,-8,0],\"p\":[0,-0.07,0],\"s\":1},\"Torso\":[8,6,0],\"Head\":[-6,2,0],\"ArmR\":[-38,0,-22],\"ForearmR\":[-70,0,0],\"HandR\":[10,0,0],\"ArmL\":[-30,0,18],\"ForearmL\":[-80,0,0],\"HandL\":[-10,0,0],\"FootR\":{\"r\":[-36.917,8,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"FootL\":{\"r\":[-30.097,8,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"LegR\":{\"r\":[-23.979,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"ShinR\":{\"r\":[60.896,0,0],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"LegL\":{\"r\":[-30.056,0,0],\"p\":[0,\n{\"name\":\"Walk\",\"frames\":12,\"loop\":true,\"keys\":[[0,{\"HandR\":[-15,0,0],\"HandL\":[-15,0,0],\"Pelvis\":{\"r\":[0,0,0],\"p\":[0,-0.08339566987447491,0],\"s\":[1.008037401924685,0.9839251961506301,1.008037401924685]},\"Torso\":{\"r\":[7,-12,-0.28232493995554314],\"p\":[0,0,0],\"s\":[1,1,1]},\"Head\":{\"r\":[-7.5,9.60000000000","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EqqEpbi5SNQdhT9bLPh47u","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
