{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm6fdxeTDmtd5CBMB9zd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added a boss-entrance cutscene this turn and re-ran the quick tests, but the plan items I flagged earlier as reduced are still reduced. The smoke, shell and layout tests pass again with 181 checks. The Bellwarden playthrough passes with 38 checks, with Malison at 122 s. I did not re-run the other two class playthroughs or the browser and hub tiers after this change.\n\n**Done**\n- **Boss entrances:** when a boss starts a fight, the camera zooms on it, letterbox bars slide in and the sim holds for about 2.6 seconds, with the taunt and name banner over it. This is outside hub sessions.\n- **Screens reviewed:** I looked at the boss arenas this turn, and earlier the title, town, gear, skills, couch HUD, attract mode and dev mode. The Bursar and Malison arenas read well: boss bar with phase ticks, taunt subtitle, name banner.\n\n**Still not done**\n- **Cutscenes:** the opening and ending are still narrated overlays, not camera sequences.\n- **Monster animation:** the Crawler, Clapperjaw and Collection Plate have no leg stepping; they only bob and lean. Malison has no animated rope arms.\n- **Pacing:** the plan's 60-minute first-player pace is unchecked. The bot clears the campaign in 12 to 19 sim minutes, and I have no way here to measure a human's pace.\n- **Screens not viewed:** I have not looked at every shot the plan lists. Skipped: each remaining zone, each class casting, the vendors, the map, dialogue, the Knell meter, About and touch."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":716,"cache_read_input_tokens":910970,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":716},"output_tokens":544,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],