{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmFghpPUnvxf2g7EHzQi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The headless tier passed on the final build: 0 failures, 328 checks. The other tiers also pass. They are sim 1769, browser 62 and hub 10, and the browser and hub runs came before my last small playthrough edits.\n\nTwo PLAN.md items are still not met:\n- **60-minute pace:** I can't measure this here. The bot finishes in about 14 sim minutes, which I estimate at about 28 for a first player, against the plan's 60. The playthrough prints that estimate and only fails if it drops under 20 minutes, so it does not enforce the target.\n- **Arm solver on Malison's forearms:** each rope arm now has an upper arm and forearm, bent by `twoBoneIK` onto a `SpringChain`. That is the plan's wording, but it is a rope-like swing rather than a placed hand, and I haven't shown it looks right in motion.\n\nThe Crawler, Clapperjaw and Plate now have two-bone legs, with `LegStepper` planting the feet and `twoBoneIK` bending the knees.\n\nThe single HTML, the dev folder and `exit-interview.json` are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1176,"cache_read_input_tokens":143571,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1176},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7f78278-523d-4db5-bad6-0b641e53d240","uuid":"71487856-2d4b-4b8c-9ca1-7dc9778edbd4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T07:08:38.738Z","request_id":"req_011CgmFghJtGbVS5CjkMKf8g"}
