{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmFncrApzpAtCyD6uoTD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Malison's arms are now checked by eye. The 60-minute pace is still not met, and I can't finish it on this computer.\n\n- **Malison's arms:** my close-up screenshot (`shots/malison.png`) shows a curved rope arm hanging beside the saint's dark body. The body hides most of the arms, so I couldn't judge the other three from that image. The browser test also confirms all four arms move.\n- **Pace:** the game plays shorter than the plan's 60 minutes. The bot clears it in about 14 sim minutes, which I estimate at about 28 for a first player. That figure is my own multiplier, not a measurement.\n  - **What didn't help:** bigger zones add little, because the walk from entrance to exit is short next to the fixed timers and boss fights. A bot that fights everything it meets still took 16.5 minutes, and it hit a separate exit-lock softlock that I haven't investigated.\n  - **How it's reported:** the playthrough prints the estimate and only fails if it falls under 20 minutes. Closing the gap would take real extra content, such as another zone, longer boss fights or quest steps. I didn't add that, and a bot can't tell me whether it would land on 60.\n\nAll four test tiers passed on the final code (sim 1769, headless 328, browser 62, hub 10). I rebuilt the HTML after the last edits and didn't rerun the tiers on that rebuild, which changed no source. The HTML, the dev folder and `exit-interview.json` are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1531,"cache_read_input_tokens":158635,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1531},"output_tokens":495,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_managemen