{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmJo1wpgVsNnc5kqcxUF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All four test tiers pass on the final build:\n\n| Tier | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Sim | 0 failures, 1769 checks |\n| Browser | 0 failures, 62 checks |\n| Hub | 0 failures, 10 checks |\n| Headless | 0 failures, 328 checks |\n\nThis follows one more fix. An earlier headless run had failed because the Sexton bot got stuck in the tutorial yard and kept ignoring the weapon drop it needed. The bot now resets its stuck timer when it heads for a drop, and the Sexton and Lamplighter playthroughs pass.\n\nOne PLAN.md item is still not met: the 60-minute pace. The bot estimates about 30 minutes for a first player. I can't measure it here, and the estimate rests on my own multiplier rather than a human playtest.\n\nMalison's arms use the engine's `twoBoneIK` on `SpringChain`, as the plan words it. My screenshot showed only one curved rope arm, because the saint's dark body hides the other three. The Crawler, Clapperjaw and Plate walk on `LegStepper` feet with `twoBoneIK` knees.\n\nThe single HTML, the dev folder and `exit-interview.json` are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":193772,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":587},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7f78278-523d-4db5-bad6-0b641e53d240","uuid":"ae0e064a-53ab-4bbd-b38c-2597d8903789","timestamp":"2026-11-06T07:49:24.753Z","request_id":"req_011CgmJo1WH94ATsFgePNVw4"}
