{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmYAkm9TVoLkiCji9RQ2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm stopping here. The pacing item will stay open, and I won't keep adding stages to move a number I made up.\n\n- **The 60-minute figure can't be checked here.** My 37–46 minute estimate is the bot's clear time multiplied by a factor I chose, plus fixed time for reading and shopping. I picked that multiplier, so I could nudge the estimate to 60 by adding zones or changing the factor without any change a player would feel. Filling the game with copies of the same zones to hit a number would also make it worse.\n- **What a human playtest would settle:** the real clear time for a first player, and whether extra stages are wanted at all.\n- **Malison's arms:** the browser test confirms all four arms move on `twoBoneIK` and `SpringChain`. The summit is dark, and her body and the pillars hide the arms. My screenshots show them only as overlapping hanging ropes.\n- **Everything else:** all four test tiers passed on the final build (sim 1769, browser 62, hub 10, headless 328 checks, 0 failures). The single HTML, the dev folder and `exit-interview.json` are in `work/`.\n\nNothing further on this computer would close either item."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":756,"cache_read_input_tokens":244421,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":756},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7f78278-523d-4db5-bad6-0b641e53d240","uuid":"7fbc8324-094e-4733-9312-34ce319f5066","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:44:53.200Z","request_id":"req_011CgmYAkWWMiZGYxmxV1nhd"}
