{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmYBWbsztAcftucGQ4Bs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My position hasn't changed, and I'm not going to run further rounds on this.\n\n**Still open:**\n- **60-minute pace:** my estimate is 37–46 minutes for a first player. It comes from a bot's clear time times a factor I chose, so I can't confirm the real figure here. Only a human playtest can.\n- **Malison's arms:** the browser test confirms all four arms move on `twoBoneIK` and `SpringChain`. My screenshots show them only as overlapping hanging ropes. The summit is dark and her body hides most of the arms, so I have no clean view.\n\n**Done:** all four test tiers passed on the final build (sim 1769, browser 62, hub 10, headless 328 checks, 0 failures). The single HTML, the dev folder and `exit-interview.json` are in `work/`.\n\nI can't close those two items on this computer, so you'll need to accept them as open or decide what to do about them. If you want a fix, I'd need a decision from you: either add real content (more zones, longer fights) or change the plan's 60-minute target."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1128,"cache_read_input_tokens":245177,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1128},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7f78278-523d-4db5-bad6-0b641e53d240","uuid":"93e32dcc-ed5f-461e-9d2f-1d3572173a7e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:44:58.756Z","request_id":"req_011CgmYBWFJLrDAUKt8Qhpo5"}
