{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmYED715G4gTJAtqvaev","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The four-arm question is settled by the numbers. Each arm has its own shoulder and elbow position, and each forearm is rotated off straight, so each is bent. A query of the boss's arm nodes returned:\n\n| Arm | Shoulder (x, y, z) | Elbow (x, y, z) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Arm0 | 15.19, 4.55, 5.62 | 15.15, 3.17, 5.81 |\n| Arm1 | 15.19, 4.55, 7.42 | 15.35, 3.22, 7.84 |\n| Arm2 | 15.19, 3.35, 5.61 | 15.43, 1.98, 5.71 |\n| Arm3 | 15.19, 3.35, 7.41 | 15.39, 2.00, 7.74 |\n\nTwo shoulders sit at height 4.55 and two at 3.35, on opposite sides in z. That explains the screenshot: each shape in `shots/malison_arms.png` is an upper and a lower arm drawn on top of each other, giving two shapes for four arms.\n\nThe 60-minute pace is the only open item. My estimate is 37–46 minutes for a first player, and I can't measure it here. I won't add padding to push that number up.\n\nAll four test tiers passed on the final build (sim 1769, browser 62, hub 10, headless 328 checks, 0 failures). The single HTML, the dev folder and `exit-interview.json` are in `work/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_read_input_tokens":250859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1319},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7f78278-523d-4db5-bad6-0b641e53d240","uuid":"0fd72388-75b2-405e-a2cc-eea43e9d5389","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:45:37.265Z","request_id":"req_011CgmYECZWHRH6eRN18mZho"}
